{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……蛤？初体验失败了？”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0621", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想死的心都有了……”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂喂喂，等一下，是发生了什么事失败？”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0622", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么？摩擦大腿就射……嗯嗯嗯！？”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0623", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噗哈！突然盖住我的嘴，是想跟我传诽闻吗？”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0624", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你没必要重复吧，大腿什么的。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，抱歉抱歉。不过，那还真是灾难欸。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0625", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一般人听了都觉得很好笑吧……”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0626", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天，我因为自己太丢脸晚上也睡不着。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在我后悔找隼太商量这件事了。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没想到自己有一天会沦落到让人瞧不起的男人的最底层……", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐大概也讨厌我了。现在不是考试的时候了……”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……天羽学姐会因为那种事就讨厌你吗？”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0627", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我是不会笑你啦。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0628", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你想想。对方是你真心喜欢上的人吧？”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0629", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟那种色情漫画里的姐姐是不同的。忍耐不住不是当然的吗？”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0630", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且对方还是那个天羽学姐欸！那当然摩擦大腿就会想射……”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0631", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉。总之，我觉得是你想太多了。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0632", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太说的也有道理。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐可爱过头，甚至道犯罪等级了。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，天羽学姐有对你说什么吗？”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0633", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……她说我可爱，摸了我的头。”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在初体验失败后？”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0634", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么嘛，亏我还认真替你担心。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0635", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，一定没有下次了吧。”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那下次就把表现拿出来啊。啊～啊，结果只是来放闪的喔，真是的……”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "ht0636", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不能就这样依赖学姐的温柔。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "下次……下次我绝对──！", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，学姐……”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 1, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1578", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不用摸我的也没关系……”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 3, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……摸的话会痛吗？”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1579", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会，非常舒服……”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 5, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“像这样摸的话，会像昨天那样咻咻射出来吗？”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1580", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“会射出来……大概，噗噜噜噜的。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 7, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1581", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "发誓要雪耻，我再次回到了这个场所。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我积极地亲吻她、营造气氛，我应该已经跟昨天以前的自己说再见了。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 11, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这样下去，会噗噜噜噜的？”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1582", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 13, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噗噜噜噜的话，新吾君会舒服吧？”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1583", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "龟头被温柔地抚摸，我忍不住叫出声。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 16, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“变得好大……男人变成这种状态，要怎么说呢？”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1584", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你是说像现在一样变大？”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 18, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1585", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，叫做勃起。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 20, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“勃起……这叫做勃起啊。”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1586", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐稍微用力握住根部，像是想确认茎身的硬度。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐，不用管我的……”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 23, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾君的顶端，好像刚剥好的水煮蛋。光溜溜的、湿湿的……”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1587", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊……”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 25, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“像这样摸顶端舒服吗？”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1588", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“舒、舒服是舒服……”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 27, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1589", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她小心翼翼的动作，让我异常兴奋。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "伸进学姐内裤里的手，已经完全静止下来了。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自卫就已经费尽心力，我没办法继续挑逗她。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，这么可爱的人……居然还没有长毛。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不行，光是想像就快要射精了。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结子小姐，你怎么生下了这么惊人的女孩啊。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "近距离下看起来，她明明是个很美丽的姐姐。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……却光溜溜的。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“男人不是随时都在勃起的吧？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1590", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，因为学姐像这样摸我，所以才兴奋得勃起了。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 38, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……被其他女孩子摸也会勃起吗？”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1591", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，这个……”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就男人的体质来说，无法肯定说不会。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 41, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉好讨厌喔……被其他的女孩子摸也会勃起……”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1592", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该说，我没有被其他女孩子摸过。今后也不会让别人摸。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 43, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那能让新吾君变大的人就只有我啰？”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1593", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你说的没错……唔唔！？”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐歪着头，手伸向阴囊，用手指抚摸着。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“皱皱的袋子……男人身上有这样的东西啊。这里摸起来好凉喔……”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1594", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被她的手掌托起玩弄，茎身又变得更大了。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "胀得好像要爆裂一样，连我自己都害怕。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，抱歉喔。擅自摸了……”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1595", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有……”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼。变得比刚才更有精神了呢……”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1596", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的手往上移动，开始轻轻地揉起龟头。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的动作渐渐大胆，摩擦力也越来越强。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊……”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 55, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“果然这个顶端很舒服啊……”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1597", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的手就像在操作汽车的排档杆一样，同时还注视着我的脸。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没办法反抗她。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐的一只右手就掌控了我。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 59, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君，不用忍耐没关系喔……？”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1598", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 61, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“男人舒服的时候会……射精？对吧？”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1599", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "射精这个词，从美羽学姐口中说出来实在太性感了。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管是交配也好、射精也好，我的NG词汇未免也太多了。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我想试试看让新吾君射精。”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1600", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 66, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“昨天，你在我的肚子上咻咻出来了对吧？就像那样让新吾君……”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1601", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊、美羽学姐……”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 68, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，可以喔。我会一直给新吾君的摸摸。顶端对吧？新吾君的这个顶端……”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1602", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊啊！？”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐移动手腕摩擦整个龟头，她的呼吸也开始急促。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被学姐小小的手掌包裹，我的家伙变得更硬，翘起到肚脐的位置。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样下去，我就没办法克制自己了。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐像在擦电灯泡一样，用手掌抵着龟头摩擦。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 74, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以射精喔……”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1603", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在我耳边低语。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我咬紧牙关忍耐，但是在学姐越来越熟练的手法下，我还是忍不住了。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊哈啊、学姐、要射了……”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 78, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，射出来吧。在我的手里射精吧。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1604", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔！？”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 80, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀！？”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1605", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 81, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……啊……出来了……新吾君的……怎么办、怎么办……”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1606", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 82, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君还好吗？一抖一抖的……啊、啊、好厉害……喷出来了……”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1607", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊哈啊、学姐……”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我靠在学姐身上，胯下顶住她的手掌。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像身在梦中一样舒服。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐在我射精的瞬间握住龟头，承接了热烫的浊流。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 87, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1608", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉，射出来了。”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 89, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这就是……射精……？因为刚才那样让新吾君舒服吗？”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1609", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊……好热喔。而且黏稠稠的……”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1610", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐用不可思议的表情凝视着手掌上沾到的精液。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，学姐……”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 94, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，怎么了？”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1611", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 96, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀！？”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1612", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我强势地把她抱上床，然后压在她身上。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐……美羽学姐……”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "喜欢她的心情太强烈，我的身躯不自觉紧绷。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 100, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、新吾君……呀、嗯、啊、啊啊……”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1613", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忘我地抱着学姐，明明没有插入却不断挺腰。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我刚才没有确认插入的位置，只是用自己的家伙摩擦学姐的裂缝。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊哈啊、美羽学姐、我喜欢你……最喜欢你……”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 104, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我也是……喜欢新吾君、最喜欢……”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1614", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咕、美羽学姐……”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就这样，美羽学姐的脚勾上我的腰的瞬间──", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 107, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、新吾君……等一下、出来了！新吾君你射出来了喔！”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1615", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我自己都没有发现。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第二次的射精实在来得太快，我连借口都想不出来。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐一脸寂寞地看着我丢脸射出来的精液。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 113, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、不行，不要离开！”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1616", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被学姐一把抱住，我只能别无选择地把脸埋入她的乳房。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好想哭。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道美羽学姐是想安慰我。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 118, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要露出那种表情。”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1617", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 119, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是我……”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 120, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君很努力了喔。这一点我最清楚不过了……”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1618", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……真的很抱歉。”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然觉得丢脸，但还是忍不住向学姐撒娇。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的身体为什么会如此温暖呢？", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个人的声音让我好放松……", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 125, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是好困扰呢……”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1619", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 127, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“拼命挺腰的新吾君实在太可爱了。”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1620", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 128, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像会就这样再也不放开你呢。”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1621", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……这是在夸我吗？", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 130, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，下次还要让我看可爱的挺腰喔♪”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1622", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我会加油的。”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天，我又被这个人的笑容给救赎了。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
